@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@authCookieName = fc_access_token

# Atualize este token após fazer sign-in em auth.http
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6ImFkbWluQGZpbmFuY2Vjb250cm9sLmNvbSIsInN1YiI6ImNjZWE1ZTk1LTBkNTgtNDAzYy1iYjY3LTkyOTRjNTJjZTExMyIsImlhdCI6MTc3NzY5MjU3NywiZXhwIjoxNzc4Mjk3Mzc3fQ.M1LMtPu_x-OZXcC_IDKdZyVemigKUuUP6Z_ewHq9SnE

# Preencha depois de criar uma dívida
@debtId = 2cb86b6b-1158-48a9-96e0-44b4cc81da83

# Use o id da categoria Parcelas, Outros ou Combustível
@expenseCategoryId = 720eded5-dac0-4186-b9d2-1f59c7bdc37e
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------
### DEBTS - SETUP DE APOIO
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Atualizar Wallet antes de pagar dívida
# Necessário porque o pagamento debita BANK, CASH ou RECEIVABLE.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "bankBalance": 1500,
  "cashBalance": 200,
  "receivableBalance": 450
}

###

### Consultar Wallet antes do pagamento
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

###

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------
### DEBTS - CREATE / LIST
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Criar dívida
# @name createDebt
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/debts
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 300,
  "description": "Nova divida cartão NUBANK",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-10",
  "type": "ONE_TIME",
  "notes": "Teste manual do módulo Debts"
}

###

### Criar dívida parcelada (3x de R$1.000,00 — confirma arredondamento: 333.33, 333.33, 333.34)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/installments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "description": "Cartão Letícia",
  "amount": 1000,
  "dueDate": "2026-08-29",
  "installmentCount": 3
}

###

### Criar dívida parcelada com observação (Loja Magazine — Parcela 01/02)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/installments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "description": "Compra TV",
  "amount": 600,
  "dueDate": "2026-08-29",
  "installmentCount": 2,
  "notes": "Loja Magazine"
}

###

### Erro: número de parcelas fora do intervalo (2-12) -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/installments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "description": "Cartão Letícia",
  "amount": 1000,
  "dueDate": "2026-08-29",
  "installmentCount": 15
}

###

### Erro: sem autenticação -> 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/installments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "Cartão Letícia",
  "amount": 1000,
  "dueDate": "2026-08-29",
  "installmentCount": 3
}

###

### Listar dívidas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debts
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

###

### Listar dívidas pendentes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/pending
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

###

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------
### DEBTS - UPDATE
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Atualizar dívida
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/{{debtId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 350.00,
  "description": "Parcela do cartão NUBANK atualizado",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-12",
  "type": "ONE_TIME",
  "notes": "Valor corrigido"
}

###

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------
### DEBTS - PAY
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Pagar dívida com BANK
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/{{debtId}}/pay
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "paidAt": "2026-05-12",
  "expenseCategoryId": "{{expenseCategoryId}}",
  "paymentSource": "BANK"
}

###

### Pagar dívida com CASH
# Use apenas com uma dívida ainda PENDING.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/{{debtId}}/pay
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "paidAt": "2026-05-12",
  "expenseCategoryId": "{{expenseCategoryId}}",
  "paymentSource": "CASH"
}

###

### Pagar dívida com RECEIVABLE
# Use apenas com uma dívida ainda PENDING.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/{{debtId}}/pay
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "paidAt": "2026-05-12",
  "expenseCategoryId": "{{expenseCategoryId}}",
  "paymentSource": "RECEIVABLE"
}

###

### Listar pendentes após pagamento
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/pending
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

###

### Consultar Wallet após pagamento
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

###

### Consultar histórico Finance após pagamento
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/history?startDate=2026-05-01&endDate=2026-05-31&type=EXPENSE
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

###

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------
### DEBTS - DELETE
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Excluir dívida
# Preferencialmente teste com dívida PENDING.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/{{debtId}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

###

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------
### DEBTS - CENÁRIOS DE ERRO
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Criar dívida sem autenticação
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/debts
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "amount": 100,
  "description": "Dívida sem token",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-10",
  "type": "ONE_TIME",
  "notes": "Deve retornar 401"
}

###

### Criar dívida com payload inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/debts
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": -10,
  "description": "",
  "dueDate": "2026-99-99",
  "type": "INVALID",
  "notes": "Deve retornar erro de validação"
}

###

### Atualizar dívida com id inválido
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/id-invalido
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 175.50,
  "description": "Dívida com id inválido",
  "dueDate": "2026-05-12",
  "type": "ONE_TIME",
  "notes": "Deve retornar erro de validação"
}

###

### Pagar dívida com paymentSource inválido
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/{{debtId}}/pay
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "paidAt": "2026-05-12",
  "expenseCategoryId": "{{expenseCategoryId}}",
  "paymentSource": "PIX"
}

###

### Pagar dívida com categoria inválida
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/{{debtId}}/pay
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "paidAt": "2026-05-12",
  "expenseCategoryId": "categoria-invalida",
  "paymentSource": "BANK"
}

###

### Pagar dívida sem autenticação
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/{{debtId}}/pay
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "paidAt": "2026-05-12",
  "expenseCategoryId": "{{expenseCategoryId}}",
  "paymentSource": "BANK"
}

###

### Excluir dívida sem autenticação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/debts/{{debtId}}